== Effects ==
* Using the Credit Card in a {{r|Shop}} instantly removes the cost of all items in that shop, allowing Isaac to take all of them for free.
* Using the Credit Card in a {{r|Devil Room}} or {{r|Black Market}} allows Isaac to take all the items without any health cost.
** Taking Devil Room items with the Credit Card does not prevent {{r|Angel Room}}s from appearing.

== Notes ==
* Being a [[special card]], the '''Credit Card''' has a significantly lower chance of appearing compared to other cards.
* Free items will remain free, even if Isaac leaves the current room.
* Works with the {{i|Blank Card}}, allowing Isaac to purchase all items from every {{r|Shop}}, if used correctly.
* {{dlc+|a}} Using the Credit Card in a Shop prevents {{i|Restock}} from working in this Shop only. However, {{m|Shop Restock Machine}}s will work, creating new items.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc|r}} Can be used in the starting room of {{s|Dark Room}}, allowing all four items to be taken for free.

== Trivia ==
* Credit Card is given significantly more detail in its [https://bindingofisaacfoursouls.fandom.com/wiki/Loot_deck Four Souls card], showing it to be owned by Isaac's [[Mom]].
** The Credit Card itself is from "Heavenly Rewards", with a symbol resembling an upside-down {{i|Godhead}} in the bottom right corner.
** The last four digits on the Credit Card are "0109", a reference to a bug involving the {{m|Greed Donation Machine}} that was later incorporated in an [[Keeper_ARG|ARG]] that added {{c|Keeper}} to the game.

